I sent Takashi an email mentioning this regression a month ago, and=20
it's taken me this long to send this email... :-$

Since updating to kernel versions >=3D3.15 I've had no audio from my=20
laptop speakers.  Earlier versions worked fine.

It's a CLEVO W270EUQ laptop.  The output mixer device is showing up,=20
but no sound comes out at any volume level.

As requested I've attached compressed alsa-info.sh output for both the=20
working and non-working cases.

I'm perfectly willing to test patches etc.


